{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55477","headline":"金莲步 · 唐镐","name":"金莲步","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金陵佳丽不虚传，浦浦荷花水上仙。\n未会与民同乐意，却於宫里看金莲。\n（见周密《浩然斋雅谈》卷中。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷七九五收镐诗二句。\n但姓名误爲齐镐。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐镐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}